> x = c (1,3,5,7,9)
> x
[1] 1 3 5 7 9
> x_df = as.data.frame (x[1:10])
> x_df
   x[1:10]
1        1
2        3
3        5
4        7
5        9
6       NA
7       NA
8       NA
9       NA
10      NA
---------------------
